{"schema":1,"locale":"zh-Hans","created_at":"2026-11-28T17:29:20.546Z","entries":{"docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ovpn-client **Type:** Directory":"## interface/ovpn-client \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ovpn-client/monitor **Type:** Command":"## interface/ovpn-client/monitor \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ovpn-server **Type:** Directory":"## interface/ovpn-server \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ovpn-server/monitor **Type:** Command":"## interface/ovpn-server/monitor \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ovpn-server/server **Type:** Directory":"## interface/ovpn-server/server \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ovpn-server/server/export-client-configuration **Type:** Command":"## interface/ovpn-server/server/export-client-configuration \n**类型：** Command","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ppp-client/at-chat **Type:** Command":"## interface/ppp-client/at-chat \n**类型：** Command","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ppp-client/firmware-upgrade **Type:** Command":"## interface/ppp-client/firmware-upgrade \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ppp-client/info **Type:** Command":"## interface/ppp-client/info \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ppp-client/monitor **Type:** Command":"## interface/ppp-client/monitor \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u00001. Include members are added to the interface list. 2. Exclude members are removed from the list. 3. Statically configured members are added to the list.":"1. 将 include 成员添加到接口列表。\n2. 从列表中移除 exclude 成员。\n3. 将静态配置的成员添加到列表。","docs-7.25\u0000:::info Dynamic interfaces are interfaces that have a \"dynamic\" flag. Any interface that does not have a dynamic flag will be part of the `static` interface list. :::":":::info\n动态接口是具有“dynamic”标志的接口。任何不具有 dynamic 标志的接口都属于 `static` 接口列表。\n:::","docs-7.25\u0000An interface is created for each tunnel established to the specified server. There are two types of interfaces in the OVPN server configuration:":"系统会为连接到指定服务器的每个隧道创建一个接口。OVPN 服务器配置中有两种接口类型：","docs-7.25\u0000Interface lists allow defining a set of interfaces for easier interface management in different interface-based configuration sections such as Neighbour Discovery, Firewall, Bridge, and Internet Detect.":"接口列表允许定义一组接口，以便在基于接口的不同配置部分（例如 Neighbour Discovery、Firewall、Bridge 和 Internet Detect）中更轻松地管理接口。","docs-7.25\u0000Members are added to an interface list in the following order:":"成员按以下顺序添加到接口列表：","docs-7.25\u0000There are four predefined lists: `all`(contains all interfaces), `none`(contains no interfaces), `dynamic`(contains dynamic interfaces), and `static`(contains static interfaces). You can also create additional interface lists.":"有四个预定义列表：`all`（包含所有接口）、`none`（不包含任何接口）、`dynamic`（包含动态接口）和 `static`（包含静态接口）。你还可以创建其他接口列表。"}}
